{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54629","headline":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"营郡邑，天上忽雷鸣（辛本、川本作「声」）。\n欲似雷鸣还不是（辛本、川本作「似」），多应土地注长（二字据辛本、川本补）倾，否则（辛本、川本作「即」）战将争。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}